L**.\n- `cargo build --release` succeeds with no warnings or errors; nothing in `c_src/` was modified.\n\nOne note for context: because this library is a single 40-line file, I did the work directly rather than delegating — spawning sub-agents would have added verification overhead without splitting any real workload."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":570,"cache_read_input_tokens":22372,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":570,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1266c3ff-14d9-4ff8-b901-aa4953a2e360","uuid":"bc86e55f-ce7b-45d0-94d2-bafeca1b4c52","timestamp":"2026-08-17T21:04:10.943Z"}
